INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (12, '5-quick-and-easy-rice-cooking-wine-recipes', 'recipe/5-quick-and-easy-rice-cooking-wine-recipes', 'recipe', '5 Quick and Easy Rice Cooking Wine Recipes', '5 Quick and Easy Rice Cooking Wine Recipes', 'Elevate your culinary skills with Rice Wine in our latest recipes! Explore 5 Quick and Easy Rice Cooking Wine Recipes and enjoy 5 Quick and Easy recipes that add a delightful twist to your meals.', 'Discover the versatility of rice wine in these five quick recipes, adding depth of flavour to stir-fries and marinades. Elevate your culinary journey with this delightful addition!

## 1. Teriyaki Chicken Stir-Fry

![Teriyaki Chicken Stir-Fry](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Teriyaki-Chicken-Stir-Fry.webp)

Indulge in the exquisite taste of Teriyaki Chicken Stir-Fry, where succulent chicken meets a medley of colorful vegetables, all bathed in a delicious teriyaki sauce enriched with the subtle sweetness of rice wine.

**Ingredients:**

- Chicken breast, sliced

- Mixed vegetables (bell peppers, broccoli, carrots)

- Soy sauce

- Rice wine

- Brown sugar

- Garlic, minced

- Ginger, grated

- Sesame oil

- Sesame seeds for garnish
**Instructions:**

- Sauté sliced chicken in sesame oil until browned.

- Add mixed vegetables, minced garlic, and grated ginger.

- Mix soy sauce, rice wine, and brown sugar in a bowl; pour over the stir-fry.

- Stir until the sauce thickens and coats the ingredients.

- Garnish with sesame seeds and serve over rice.

## 2. Sake Glazed Salmon

![Sake Glazed Salmon](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Sake-Glazed-Salmon.webp)

Elevate your seafood experience with Sake Glazed Salmon, a delectable dish where the richness of salmon meets the sweet and savoury notes of a sake-infused glaze.

**Ingredients:**

- Salmon fillets

- Sake (Japanese rice wine)

- Soy sauce

- Mirin

- Brown sugar

- Garlic, minced

- Lemon wedges for serving
**Instructions:**

- Mix sake, soy sauce, mirin, brown sugar, and minced garlic in a bowl.

- Marinate salmon fillets in the mixture for at least 30 minutes.

- Grill or pan-sear the salmon until cooked to your liking.

- Baste with the sake glaze during cooking.

- Serve with lemon wedges for a burst of freshness.
Continue reading for more enticing rice wine recipes!

## 3. Shaoxing Wine Chicken Rice

![Shaoxing Wine Chicken Rice](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Shaoxing-Wine-Chicken-Rice.webp)

Delight your taste buds with Shaoxing Wine Chicken Rice, a Chinese-inspired comfort dish where tender chicken is infused with the aromatic essence of Shaoxing rice wine.

**Ingredients:**

- Chicken thighs, bone-in

- Shaoxing rice wine

- Soy sauce

- Ginger, sliced

- Garlic, minced

- Green onions, chopped

- Sesame oil

- Steamed jasmine rice for serving
**Instructions:**

- Marinate chicken thighs in Shaoxing rice wine and soy sauce.

- Sauté sliced ginger and minced garlic until fragrant.

- Add marinated chicken and cook until browned.

- Pour in more Shaoxing rice wine and let it simmer until chicken is cooked.

- Drizzle with sesame oil, garnish with chopped green onions, and serve over steamed jasmine rice.

## 4. Rice Wine Mushroom Sauce Pasta

![Rice Wine Mushroom Sauce Pasta](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Rice-Wine-Mushroom-Sauce-Pasta.webp)

Give your pasta a unique twist with Rice Wine Mushroom Sauce, a rich and earthy sauce that complements your favorite pasta shape.

**Ingredients:**

- Button mushrooms, sliced

- Onion, finely chopped

- Rice wine

- Heavy cream

- Parmesan cheese, grated

- Olive oil

- Garlic, minced

- Salt and pepper to taste

- Fresh parsley for garnish

- Cooked pasta of your choice
**Instructions:**

- Sauté finely chopped onion and minced garlic in olive oil until softened.

- Add sliced mushrooms and cook until browned.

- Pour in rice wine and let it simmer.

- Stir in heavy cream and grated Parmesan cheese.

- Season with salt and pepper, toss with cooked pasta, and garnish with fresh parsley.

## 5. Rice Wine Ginger Pork Bao Buns

![Rice Wine Ginger Pork Bao Buns](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Rice-Wine-Ginger-Pork-Bao-Buns.webp)

Transport your taste buds to the streets of Taiwan with Rice Wine Ginger Pork Bao Buns, where tender pork is marinated in a flavourful blend of rice wine and ginger.

**Ingredients:**

- Pork belly slices

- Rice wine

- Soy sauce

- Brown sugar

- Fresh ginger, grated

- Hoisin sauce

- Chinese-style bao buns

- Fresh cilantro for garnish
**Instructions:**

- Marinate pork belly slices in rice wine, soy sauce, brown sugar, and grated ginger.

- Pan-fry the pork until golden and cooked.

- Spread hoisin sauce on the inside of each bao bun.

- Place a slice of rice wine ginger pork inside each bun.

- Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve.

## Final thoughts

Discover five quick and easy rice wine recipes, from Teriyaki Chicken Stir-Fry to Rice Wine Ginger Pork Bao Buns, each bringing a unique twist to your kitchen. Ready to enhance your cooking? Explore VATTI appliances for tools that elevate and simplify your culinary adventures!

