INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (13, '5-delicous-and-easy-rice-cooker-recipes-for-every-meal', 'recipe/5-delicous-and-easy-rice-cooker-recipes-for-every-meal', 'recipe', '5 Delicious and Easy Rice Cooker Recipes for Every Meal', '5 Easy and Delicious Rice Cooker Recipes for Every Meal', 'Make every meal a breeze with 5 Delicious and Easy Rice Cooker Recipes. From breakfast to dinner, these quick and tasty dishes will showcase the versatility of your rice cooker.', 'Make cooking a breeze with your rice cooker as we explore five simple and mouthwatering recipes for every meal. From hearty mains to sweet treats, let your rice cooker do the work while you enjoy delicious homemade dishes effortlessly.

## 1. One-Pot Chicken and Rice

![One-Pot Chicken and Rice](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/One-Pot-Chicken-and-Rice.webp)

Simplify dinner with our One-Pot Chicken and Rice. Just toss the ingredients into your rice cooker, press a button, and let it work its magic. A flavourful and wholesome meal ready in no time!

**Ingredients:**

- Chicken thighs

- Rice

- Chicken broth

- Mixed vegetables

- Garlic powder

- Onion powder

- Paprika

- Salt and pepper
**Instructions:**

- Place chicken thighs, rice, and mixed vegetables in the rice cooker.

- Add chicken broth, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, salt, and pepper.

- Close the lid, select the rice cooker setting, and let it cook until done.
Continue reading for more convenient rice cooker recipes!

## 2. Creamy Mushroom Risotto

![Creamy Mushroom Risotto](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Creamy-Mushroom-Risotto.webp)

Indulge in the velvety goodness of our Creamy Mushroom Risotto, made effortlessly in your rice cooker. This classic Italian dish is rich, satisfying, and requires minimal effort.

**Ingredients:**

- Chicken thighs

- Rice

- Chicken broth

- Mixed vegetables

- Garlic powder

- Onion powder

- Paprika

- Salt and pepper
**Instructions:**

- Place chicken thighs, rice, and mixed vegetables in the rice cooker.

- Add chicken broth, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, salt, and pepper.

- Close the lid, select the rice cooker setting, and let it cook until done.
Continue reading for more convenient rice cooker recipes!

## 3. Sweet and Savory Pineapple Fried Rice

![Sweet and Savory Pineapple Fried Rice](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Sweet-and-Savory-Pineapple-Fried-Rice.webp)

Add a tropical twist to your meals with Sweet and Savory Pineapple Fried Rice. This rice cooker recipe combines the sweetness of pineapple with savoury flavours for a delightful side dish.

**Ingredients:**

- Cooked rice

- Pineapple, diced

- Shrimp or chicken, cooked (optional)

- Peas and carrots, frozen

- Soy sauce

- Sesame oil

- Green onions, sliced

- Cashews, chopped

- Salt and pepper
**Instructions:**

- Combine cooked rice, diced pineapple, cooked shrimp or chicken (if using), and frozen peas and carrots in the rice cooker.

- Drizzle with soy sauce and sesame oil.

- Mix in sliced green onions and chopped cashews.

- Season with salt and pepper, close the lid, and let it heat through.

## 4. Chocolate Lava Cake

![Chocolate Lava Cake](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Chocolate-Lava-Cake.webp)

Indulge your sweet tooth with a decadent Chocolate Lava Cake made right in your rice cooker. This easy dessert is a perfect way to satisfy your chocolate cravings.

**Ingredients:**

- All-purpose flour

- Cocoa powder

- Sugar

- Baking powder

- Salt

- Milk

- Vegetable oil

- Vanilla extract

- Chocolate chips
**Instructions:**

- In a bowl, whisk together flour, cocoa powder, sugar, baking powder, and salt.

- Add milk, vegetable oil, and vanilla extract; mix until smooth.

- Stir in chocolate chips.

- Pour the batter into the rice cooker and cook until set on the cake setting.

## 5. Overnight Oats

![Overnight Oats](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Overnight-Oats.webp)

Start your day right with Overnight Oats prepared effortlessly in your rice cooker. A nutritious and customizable breakfast that’s ready when you wake up.

**Ingredients:**

- Rolled oats

- Milk or yogurt

- Chia seeds

- Honey or maple syrup

- Fresh fruits and nuts for topping
**Instructions:**

- Mix rolled oats, milk or yogurt, chia seeds, and sweetener in the rice cooker.

- Close the lid and let it sit in the refrigerator overnight.

- Top with fresh fruits and nuts before serving.

## Final thoughts

Discover the joy of rice cooker cooking! From One-Pot Chicken and Rice to Chocolate Lava Cake, these recipes are a delight. Simplify your kitchen – explore VATTI appliances for a joyful cooking experience!

