INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (15, 'detox-smoothie-recipe-for-weight-loss', 'recipe/detox-smoothie-recipe-for-weight-loss', 'recipe', '5 Detox Smoothie Recipes for Weight Loss: Step-by-step Guide', '5 Best Weight Loss Smoothie Recipe', 'Shed those extra pounds with 5 Detox Smoothie Recipes for Weight Loss – a flavorful approach to a healthier you.', 'Looking for a delicious and nutritious way to shed extra pounds? These **detox smoothie recipes for weight loss** are packed with vitamins, antioxidants, and fiber to help cleanse your body and boost metabolism. Whether you want a green detox smoothie or a protein-packed option, these recipes will keep you energized throughout the day.

## 1. Green Goddess Detox Smoothie

![Green Goddess Detox Smoothie](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Green-Goddess-Detox-Smoothie.webp)

Kickstart your day with the Avocado and Bacon Egg Cups, a keto-friendly breakfast delight. This protein-packed option combines the richness of avocado with the savory goodness of bacon and eggs, creating a satisfying and nutritious morning treat.

**Ingredients:**

- Kale leaves

- Cucumber, peeled

- Green apple, cored

- Lemon juice

- Greek yogurt

- Water or coconut water

- Ice cubes
**Instructions:**

- Blend kale, cucumber, green apple, lemon juice, Greek yogurt, water or coconut water, and ice cubes until smooth.

- Pour into a glass and enjoy this revitalizing green powerhouse.
Continue reading for more weight-loss-friendly smoothie recipes!

## 2. Berry Blast Protein Smoothie

![Berry Blast Protein Smoothie](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Berry-Blast-Protein-Smoothie.webp)

Fuel your workouts and support muscle recovery with the Berry Blast Protein Smoothie. Packed with berries and protein-rich ingredients, it’s a tasty and satisfying option for those aiming to shed pounds.

**Ingredients:**

- Mixed berries (strawberries, blueberries, raspberries)

- Protein powder (vanilla or berry-flavored)

- Almond milk

- Greek yogurt

- Chia seeds

- Honey (optional)

- Ice cubes
**Instructions:**

- Blend mixed berries, protein powder, almond milk, Greek yogurt, chia seeds, honey (optional), and ice cubes until smooth.

- Pour into a glass and enjoy this delicious protein-packed treat.

## 3. Tropical Turmeric Smoothie

![Tropical Turmeric Smoothie](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Tropical-Turmeric-Smoothie.webp)

Boost your metabolism and reduce inflammation with the Tropical Turmeric Smoothie. This vibrant blend of pineapple, mango, and turmeric is not only delicious but also supports your weight loss journey.

**Ingredients:**

- Frozen pineapple chunks

- Frozen mango chunks

- Turmeric powder

- Coconut milk

- Greek yogurt

- Chia seeds

- Ice cubes
**Instructions:**

- Blend frozen pineapple chunks, frozen mango chunks, turmeric powder, coconut milk, Greek yogurt, chia seeds, and ice cubes until smooth.

- Pour into a glass and savor the tropical goodness.

## 4. Spinach and Banana Power Smoothie

![Spinach and Banana Power Smoothie](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Spinach-and-Banana-Power-Smoothie.webp)

Get a nutrient boost with the Spinach and Banana Power Smoothie. Packed with vitamins and minerals, this green concoction is a delicious way to support your weight loss efforts.

**Ingredients:**

- Baby spinach

- Banana

- Almond milk

- Protein powder (vanilla or unflavored)

- Peanut butter

- Honey (optional)

- Ice cubes
**Instructions:**

- Blend baby spinach, banana, almond milk, protein powder, peanut butter, honey (optional), and ice cubes until smooth.

- Pour into a glass and enjoy this nutrient-packed powerhouse.

## 5. Citrus Zinger Immune-Boosting Smoothie

![Citrus Zinger Immune-Boosting Smoothie](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/01/Citrus-Zinger-Immune-Boosting-Smoothie.webp)

Give your immune system a boost with the Citrus Zinger Immune-Boosting Smoothie. Packed with citrus fruits and a hint of ginger, this smoothie is not only refreshing but also aids in weight loss.

**Ingredients:**

- Oranges, peeled and segmented

- Grapefruit, peeled and segmented

- Lemon juice

- Ginger, grated

- Greek yogurt

- Water or coconut water

- Ice cubes
**Instructions:**

- Blend oranges, grapefruit, lemon juice, grated ginger, Greek yogurt, water or coconut water, and ice cubes until smooth.

- Pour into a glass and enjoy this zesty and immune-boosting delight.

