- **Instant Heating:** Infrared gas stoves heat up almost instantly, allowing for quick cooking and reduced waiting times.

- **Energy Efficiency:** Since infrared gas stoves transfer heat directly to the cookware, they are more energy-efficient compared to normal gas stoves.

