- **Uneven Heating:** Despite their precision control, some users may experience uneven heat distribution with infrared gas stoves, resulting in inconsistent cooking results.**RELATED:**[Is It better to Cook in Convection Oven or Regular Oven?](/buying-guide/convection-oven-or-regular-oven/)

