INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (48, 'cheesy-baked-potato', 'recipe/cheesy-baked-potato', 'recipe', 'Best Cheesy Baked Potato Recipes', 'Cheesy Baked Potato Recipes', 'Savor the delight of our Cheesy Baked Potato. Crispy on the outside, fluffy inside, and topped with gooey cheese. A perfect meal or side dish!', 'Craving a warm and comforting dish? Look no further than this Cheesy Baked Potato recipe. Loaded with gooey cheese and fluffy potato goodness, this dish is sure to satisfy your cravings and leave you feeling cozy all night long.

![Cheesy Baked Potato](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/05/Cheesy-Baked-Potato.webp)

## Before we get started

Discover the Perfect Kitchen Appliance for Your Cheesy Baked Potato Recipes!

[Check it out here](/combi-and-steam-oven-in-malaysia/)

## Step 1: Ingredients Preparation

**Prepare the ingredients:**

- 2 Large Russet Potatoes

- 1 cup Shredded Cheddar Cheese

- 1/2 cup Sour Cream

- 2 tablespoons Chopped Chives

- Salt and Pepper to Taste

## Step 2: Start to make Cheesy Baked Potato

- Preheat your oven to 400°F (200°C).

- Scrub the potatoes thoroughly and pat them dry with a paper towel.

- Prick the potatoes all over with a fork and place them directly on the oven rack.

- Bake the potatoes for about 45-60 minutes, or until they are fork-tender.

- Remove the potatoes from the oven and let them cool slightly.

- Slice each potato in half lengthwise and carefully scoop out the flesh, leaving a thin layer inside the skin.

- Mash the potato flesh with sour cream, cheddar cheese, chopped chives, salt, and pepper.

- Spoon the mashed potato mixture back into the potato skins and sprinkle with extra cheese if desired.

- Return the stuffed potatoes to the oven and bake for an additional 10-15 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.

- Serve hot and enjoy your irresistibly cheesy baked potatoes!

**RELATED:** [Acai Bowl Recipes (Quick and Easy)](/recipe/acai-bowl-recipes-quick-and-easy/)

## What Do You Eat with Cheesy Baked Potato?

- **Fresh Salad Greens:**
- Pair your cheesy baked potato with a simple salad of mixed greens tossed in a light vinaigrette for a refreshing contrast.

- **Steamed Vegetables:**
- Add some green goodness to your meal by serving your cheesy baked potato alongside steamed broccoli, cauliflower, or green beans.

- **Crispy Bacon:**
- For an extra indulgent touch, crumble crispy bacon over the top of your cheesy baked potato for a savory flavor explosion.

- **Tangy Salsa:**
- Amp up the flavor of your cheesy baked potato by topping it with tangy salsa, fresh pico de gallo, or zesty salsa verde.
## Final thoughts

Enjoy the ultimate comfort food: cheesy baked potatoes with crispy skins, fluffy interiors, and oozing cheese. Elevate your cooking with VATTI’s high-quality ovens and cooktops.

