INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (50, 'baked-sweet-potato-recipes', 'recipe/baked-sweet-potato-recipes', 'recipe', 'Best Baked Sweet Potato Recipes', 'Best Baked Sweet Potato Recipes', 'Discover enticing baked sweet potato recipes for a nutritious meal or side. From stuffed varieties to crispy fries, enjoy this versatile veggie!', 'Looking to add some nutritious and delicious dishes to your repertoire? Explore the versatility of baked sweet potato recipes! From savory to sweet, these recipes showcase the natural sweetness and hearty texture of this versatile root vegetable.

## Before we get started

Discover the Perfect Kitchen Appliance for Your Baked Sweet Potato Recipes!

[Check it out here](/combi-and-steam-oven-in-malaysia/)

![Baked Sweet Potato](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/05/Baked-Sweet-Potato.webp)

## Step 1: Ingredients Preparation

**Prepare the Sweet Potato Casserole ingredients:**

- 4 medium sweet potatoes, peeled and cubed

- 1/4 cup melted butter

- 1/4 cup brown sugar

- 1/2 teaspoon cinnamon

- 1/4 teaspoon nutmeg

**Prepare the Stuffed Sweet Potatoes ingredients:**

- 4 large sweet potatoes

- 1 cup black beans, rinsed and drained

- 1 cup corn kernels

- 1/2 cup diced tomatoes

- 1/4 cup diced red onion

- 1 avocado, diced

## Step 2: Start to make Baked Sweet Potato

## Sweet Potato Casserole:

- Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).

- Boil sweet potato cubes until tender, then mash.

- Mix in melted butter, brown sugar, cinnamon, and nutmeg.

- Spread mixture into a baking dish and bake for 25-30 minutes until golden brown.

## Stuffed Sweet Potatoes:

- Bake sweet potatoes until tender.

- Slice open and stuff with black beans, corn, tomatoes, red onion, and avocado.

- Serve with a dollop of Greek yogurt or salsa on top.

**RELATED:** [Cheesy Baked Potato Recipes](/cheesy-baked-potato/)

## What Do You Eat with Baked Sweet Potato ?

- **Grilled Salmon:**
- Pair your baked sweet potato with a piece of grilled salmon for a nutritious and satisfying meal.

- **Quinoa Salad:**
- Serve alongside a refreshing quinoa salad tossed with fresh vegetables and a tangy vinaigrette.

- **Spinach and Feta Stuffed Chicken Breast:**
- Accompany your baked sweet potato with a flavorful spinach and feta stuffed chicken breast for a hearty and wholesome dinner.

- **Greek Yogurt and Berries:**
- For a lighter option, serve your baked sweet potato with a dollop of Greek yogurt and a sprinkle of fresh berries for a satisfyingly sweet treat.

- **Roasted Brussels Sprouts:**
- Enjoy your baked sweet potato with a side of crispy roasted Brussels sprouts for a delicious contrast of flavors and textures.

**RELATED:** [Easy Oven Roasted Potatoes Recipes](/oven-roasted-potatoes/)
## Final thoughts

Baked sweet potato recipes provide tasty and nutritious options for enjoying this versatile root veggie. Whether sweet or savory, there’s a recipe to satisfy your cravings. Explore VATTI appliances for all your cooking needs and elevate your culinary game today!

[Explore Vatti Product](/combi-and-steam-oven-in-malaysia/)', 540, 3, 'Vatti Malaysia', (SELECT id FROM image WHERE legacy_url = 'https://vattimalaysia.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Baked-Sweet-Potato.webp'), '2024-05-13T21:29:37+08:00', '2026-06-10T19:50:51+08:00', 0, 1);
