INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (51, 'simple-chicken-lasagna-recipe', 'recipe/simple-chicken-lasagna-recipe', 'recipe', 'Simple Chicken Lasagna Recipe: Step-by-step Guide', 'Simple Chicken Lasagna Recipe: Step-by-step Guide', 'Try our simple chicken lasagna recipe! Packed with savory chicken, it''s perfect for any occasion. Impress your guests with this crowd-pleasing dish!', 'Looking for an easy and delicious meal? This **simple chicken lasagna recipe** is a perfect choice for a hearty and satisfying dish. Made with tender chicken, creamy cheese, and rich tomato sauce, it’s a great alternative to traditional beef lasagna.

![Chicken Lasagna Recipe](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/05/Chicken-Lasagna.webp)

## Step 1: Ingredients Preparation

**Prepare the ingredients:**

- 9 lasagna noodles

- 2 cups cooked chicken, shredded or diced

- 2 cups marinara sauce 2 cups ricotta cheese

- 1 cup shredded mozzarella cheese

- 1/2 cup grated Parmesan cheese

- 2 cloves garlic, minced

- 1 teaspoon dried oregano

- 1 teaspoon dried basil

- Salt and pepper to taste

- Fresh basil leaves for garnish (optional)

## Step 2: Start to make Chicken Lasagna

- Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C) and grease a 9×13-inch baking dish. Cook the lasagna noodles according to the package instructions until al dente. Drain and set aside.

- In a large bowl, combine the cooked chicken, marinara sauce, ricotta cheese, mozzarella cheese, Parmesan cheese, minced garlic, dried oregano, dried basil, salt, and pepper.

- Spread a thin layer of the chicken mixture on the bottom of the prepared baking dish.

- Place three lasagna noodles on top of the chicken mixture.

- Repeat the layers of chicken mixture and lasagna noodles, ending with a layer of chicken mixture on top.

- Cover the baking dish with aluminum foil and bake in the preheated oven for 30 minutes.

- Remove the foil and bake for an additional 10-15 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.

- Garnish with fresh basil leaves if desired, then let it cool slightly before slicing and serving.

## What Do You Eat with Acai Bowl ?

- **Garlic Bread:**
- Serve warm garlic bread on the side for mopping up every last bit of sauce.

- **Caesar Salad:**
- Enjoy a crisp Caesar salad with your chicken lasagna for a refreshing contrast.

- **Roasted Vegetables:**
- Add a side of roasted vegetables like zucchini, bell peppers, and carrots for a nutritious boost.

- **Italian Antipasto Platter:**
- Create an Italian-inspired antipasto platter with cured meats, cheeses, olives, and pickled vegetables for a delicious starter.

- **Tiramisu:**
- End your meal on a sweet note with a slice of homemade tiramisu for dessert.

## More Delicious Recipes to Try

Pair your lasagna with these tasty dishes:

- [Best Baked Sweet Potato Recipes](/recipe/baked-sweet-potato-recipes/)

- [Best Scallion Pancake Recipe (葱油饼)](/recipe/scallion-pancake-recipe/)

- [Sweet Potato Breakfast Hash with Black Bean Recipes](/recipe/sweet-potato-breakfast-hash-with-black-bean-recipes/)
## Final thoughts

Our chicken lasagna recipe is a crowd-pleasing dish, combining savory chicken, gooey cheese, and aromatic herbs for a comforting meal. Whether it’s family dinner or entertaining guests, this hearty lasagna is sure to impress. Simplify your cooking with VATTI appliances!

