INSERT INTO article (id, slug, path, section, title, h1, meta_description, body_md, word_count, reading_minutes, author, featured_image_id, published_at, modified_at, schema_disabled, is_published) VALUES (56, 'what-can-you-wash-in-dishwasher', 'tips-tricks/what-can-you-wash-in-dishwasher', 'tips-tricks', 'What Can You Wash in Dishwasher?', 'What Can You Wash in Dishwasher?', 'Discover what you can wash in a dishwasher safely! Learn about dishwasher-safe symbols, items to clean with ease, and more.', 'Dishwashers are a lifesaver for busy households, but have you ever wondered **what you can wash in a dishwasher ?** From everyday dishes to surprising items, understanding the do’s and don’ts ensures your dishwasher works its magic without damage.

![dishwasher](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/12/what-can-you-wash-in-dishwasher.webp)

### What is the Safe Symbol for Dishwasher?

![](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2024/12/dishwasher-symbol.webp)

To check if an item is dishwasher-safe, look for the **dishwasher-safe symbol** on the product. This symbol typically appears as a plate or glass with water droplets, often accompanied by wavy lines. If an item doesn’t have this symbol, it’s best to err on the side of caution and wash it by hand.

### What You Can Wash in Dishwasher?

Here’s a handy list of items safe to wash in your dishwasher:

| Item | Care Tips |
| --- | --- |
| Plates and bowls | Place them securely to avoid movement during the wash cycle. |
| Glassware | Use the top rack to avoid scratching or breaking. |
| Stainless steel cutlery | Avoid overcrowding to ensure proper cleaning and drying. |
| Plastic containers | Only if labeled “dishwasher-safe,” and they belong on the top rack. |
| Silicone bakeware | Check the label, and use a gentle cycle for longevity. |
| Cooking utensils | Wooden handles may require handwashing; otherwise, top rack placement. |

Surprisingly, you can also wash things like small toys (without batteries), oven racks, and even some pet dishes, just ensure they’re made from dishwasher-safe materials.

### What You Cannot Wash in Dishwasher?

Some items don’t belong in the dishwasher, as they may degrade or cause damage. Avoid putting these in your machine:

- **Non-dishwasher-safe plastics** : These can warp or melt in high heat.

- **Wooden items** : The heat and water can cause wood to crack or split.

- **Cast iron cookware** : Dishwashing strips its seasoning and causes rust.

- **Crystal and fine china** : These delicate items can chip or cloud over time.

- **Knives** : High heat dulls blades, and moisture can cause rusting.
Always refer to the manufacturer’s care instructions for your kitchenware when in doubt.

## Final thoughts

Knowing **what you can wash in a dishwasher** ensures you maximize its efficiency and extend the life of your kitchenware. By choosing the right items for your dishwasher, you can save time and energy with confidence.

**Check out VATTI dishwashers** for advanced cleaning power and reliability, making your kitchen tasks easier!

