![Induction Cooker vs Ceramic Cooker](https://pub-d0b729df0b8f422289c6f46d17d33f3e.r2.dev/2025/12/Induction-Cooker-vs-Ceramic-Cooker-2.webp)

## Ceramic Hob vs Induction Hob: Usability & Design

